    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">If the [[lookup @name lowercase]] receives the Prone condition, roll a die. On an odd number, it has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition. At the end of each of its turns, the [[lookup @name lowercase]] makes a DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=LfYXT04YlFJUhscb]] Dexterity saving throw, ending the Incapacitated condition on a success.</p>",
